  "solution": "Given:\n\nNumbers = 36, 54, 72 and 96\n\nCalculation:\n\n⇒ 36 = 3 × 4 × 3\n\n⇒ 54 = 3 × 3 × 2 × 3\n\n⇒ 72 = 2 × 3 × 3 × 4 \n\n⇒ 96 = 2 × 4 × 3 × 4\n\n⇒ LCM of 36, 54, 72 and 96 = 3 × 4 × 3 × 4 × 3 × 2 = 864\n\nTherefore, the LCM of **36, 54, 72 and 96 is 864.**",
